# Keep Unix line endings in every checkout, including Windows (Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true).
# Without this, app/static/assets/hologram.js gets CRLF on Windows and no longer matches its precompressed
# .gz/.br copies (test_bundle_is_served_precompressed fails), and shell scripts break in Git Bash.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
*.br binary
*.gz binary
